    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/73cd0d27c87e191f77cc71adbdba0a3a.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/73cd0d27c87e191f77cc71adbdba0a3a.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/73cd0d27c87e191f77cc71adbdba0a3a.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Dive into the terror that lurks in the shadows! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a chilling experience in Siren's Well, a Survival Horror game that blends suspense, adrenaline, and the vibes of 80s slasher films. Venture into the depths of the Broken Paradise Asylum, where two friends, Scarlett and Ravenna, confront their worst nightmares in a place cursed by ancient Mesopotamian gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cbb7352e3338bea61658bb2056ec729b.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cbb7352e3338bea61658bb2056ec729b.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cbb7352e3338bea61658bb2056ec729b.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Two Stories, Four Scenarios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of mystery with ORIGINAL NIGHTMARE and THE OTHER SIDE, where your choices shape the fate of the heroines. Each scenario offers unique encounters, survival challenges, and the terrifying Lunatics, insane patients who have taken over the asylum. Face relentless enemies and defeat bosses in epic battles that will test your skills and courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cf7751ceead9927c3047828aa5141364.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cf7751ceead9927c3047828aa5141364.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cf7751ceead9927c3047828aa5141364.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Capture the Ghosts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your smartphone to document the specters haunting the asylum. This is the only way to defeat them and uncover the mysteries of the place. But beware! Firearms will be your allies against the Lunatics, who have become the true face of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/04865a01fa592c0f425e3b4600f6d11f.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/04865a01fa592c0f425e3b4600f6d11f.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/04865a01fa592c0f425e3b4600f6d11f.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b Varied Arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a range of weapons, such as handguns, shotguns, and even grenade launchers. Each character has unique abilities and a distinct approach to confronting the horror, ensuring that every playthrough offers a fresh and terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/1af81bf722d7474be4c4e6128f709c9e.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/1af81bf722d7474be4c4e6128f709c9e.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/1af81bf722d7474be4c4e6128f709c9e.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 Boss Transformations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for unexpected challenges as bosses transform during combat, providing a dynamic and terrifying gameplay experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/ef19ac28da755367daf7dd0c1e70bbd8.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/ef19ac28da755367daf7dd0c1e70bbd8.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Event Date: September 28, 2008</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the fateful day when Scarlett and Ravenna decided to explore the Broken Paradise Asylum. What begins as an intriguing adventure quickly turns into an indescribable nightmare. Will you have the courage to uncover the dark secrets waiting within the asylum?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/9d7efdc5c257718215472535af01bba3.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/9d7efdc5c257718215472535af01bba3.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/9d7efdc5c257718215472535af01bba3.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Unravel the mysteries and face your fears in Siren's Well!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/73cd0d27c87e191f77cc71adbdba0a3a.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/73cd0d27c87e191f77cc71adbdba0a3a.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/73cd0d27c87e191f77cc71adbdba0a3a.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0c Dive into the terror that lurks in the shadows! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for a chilling experience in Siren's Well, a Survival Horror game that blends suspense, adrenaline, and the vibes of 80s slasher films. Venture into the depths of the Broken Paradise Asylum, where two friends, Scarlett and Ravenna, confront their worst nightmares in a place cursed by ancient Mesopotamian gods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cbb7352e3338bea61658bb2056ec729b.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cbb7352e3338bea61658bb2056ec729b.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cbb7352e3338bea61658bb2056ec729b.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd75\ufe0f\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Two Stories, Four Scenarios</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world of mystery with ORIGINAL NIGHTMARE and THE OTHER SIDE, where your choices shape the fate of the heroines. Each scenario offers unique encounters, survival challenges, and the terrifying Lunatics, insane patients who have taken over the asylum. Face relentless enemies and defeat bosses in epic battles that will test your skills and courage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cf7751ceead9927c3047828aa5141364.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=800 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cf7751ceead9927c3047828aa5141364.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/cf7751ceead9927c3047828aa5141364.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcf8 Capture the Ghosts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your smartphone to document the specters haunting the asylum. This is the only way to defeat them and uncover the mysteries of the place. But beware! Firearms will be your allies against the Lunatics, who have become the true face of terror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/04865a01fa592c0f425e3b4600f6d11f.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/04865a01fa592c0f425e3b4600f6d11f.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/04865a01fa592c0f425e3b4600f6d11f.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd2b Varied Arsenal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a range of weapons, such as handguns, shotguns, and even grenade launchers. Each character has unique abilities and a distinct approach to confronting the horror, ensuring that every playthrough offers a fresh and terrifying experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/1af81bf722d7474be4c4e6128f709c9e.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/1af81bf722d7474be4c4e6128f709c9e.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/1af81bf722d7474be4c4e6128f709c9e.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude78 Boss Transformations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for unexpected challenges as bosses transform during combat, providing a dynamic and terrifying gameplay experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/ef19ac28da755367daf7dd0c1e70bbd8.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/ef19ac28da755367daf7dd0c1e70bbd8.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddd3\ufe0f Event Date: September 28, 2008</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the fateful day when Scarlett and Ravenna decided to explore the Broken Paradise Asylum. What begins as an intriguing adventure quickly turns into an indescribable nightmare. Will you have the courage to uncover the dark secrets waiting within the asylum?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/9d7efdc5c257718215472535af01bba3.poster.avif?t=1755048828\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/9d7efdc5c257718215472535af01bba3.webm?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3272980/extras/9d7efdc5c257718215472535af01bba3.mp4?t=1755048828\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Unravel the mysteries and face your fears in Siren's Well!</p>",
